# Luna Character Bible

When generating, illustrating, or implementing **Luna (ルナ)**, the MIAV mascot:

1. Read `docs/characters/luna/CHARACTER_BIBLE.md` and use `docs/characters/luna/reference.png` as the authoritative visual reference.
2. **No design drift** — every output must depict the same character.

## Immutable features (never change)

- Floppy ears — **never upright**
- Medium-blue round nose `#58A7E6`
- Blue paw pads `#58A7E6`
- Small blue mesh on forehead/fringe only `#CFE6FF` (subtle)
- Thin dark-blue ring on **left front leg only** `#2E7BCB` — not a collar
- Shiba-like curled cream tail
- Base fur `#FFF5EC` / shadow `#F1E7D6`
- Ordinary-dog appearance — no robot/cyber styling

## Forbidden (NG)

Robot parts, LED eyes, metal joints, mecha ears, collar/leash, armor, cyber aesthetic, upright ears, rings on other legs, excessive head mesh, palette drift from official hex codes.

## On conflict

Reference image > Character Bible text > general MIAV style.
